# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Exact /us (and trailing slash) → domain root. Do NOT splat /us/* —
# /us/guides and /us/assets must keep serving at their current paths.
/us https://www.shopapgo.com/ 301
/us/ https://www.shopapgo.com/ 301
#
# The order back office (public/admin/) only works on the store Worker's admin host. This host builds the same export
# until the cutover, so /admin is sent away here (on Pages a redirect wins over a file at the same path).
/admin / 302
/admin/* / 302
